A3 — Is there a Claims / Portfolio / Product Line tag
fetch dt.entity.host
| fields id, entity.name, tags
| expand tags
| filter contains(lower(tags), "claim")
   or contains(lower(tags), "portfolio")
   or contains(lower(tags), "product")
| summarize hosts = countDistinctExact(id), by:{tags}
| sort hosts desc
| limit 200
